10	0	Affordable and Transparent Pricing	Enjoy budget-friendly fares with no hidden charges, ensuring a hassle-free experience. Our fare estimates provide transparency, allowing customers to plan their trips with confidence. Get the best value for your ride without compromising on quality.	Harold Henderson	data:image/jpeg;base64,	t	2025-02-17 13:11:48.447775	2025-02-17 13:11:48.447775
12	2	Easy Booking and Quick Pickups	Book your ride effortlessly through our user-friendly app or website in just a few taps. With a vast network of drivers, we guarantee prompt pickups and minimal waiting time. Experience convenience at your fingertips for all your travel needs.	Harold Henderson	data:image/jpeg;base64,	t	2025-02-17 16:19:38.314082	2025-02-17 16:19:38.314082
9	1	Reliable and Safe Rides	Our cab service ensures a secure and comfortable journey with well-maintained vehicles and professional drivers. We prioritize passenger safety with real-time tracking and 24/7 customer support. Whether day or night, travel with confidence and peace of mind.	Chamin Anderson	data:image/jpeg;base64,	t	2025-01-25 16:58:54.517366	2025-01-25 16:58:54.517366
16	0	Multiple Ride Options for Every Need	Choose from a variety of ride options, including economy, premium, and larger vehicles for group travel. Whether you need a quick city ride, airport transfer, or outstation trip, we have you covered. Enjoy a comfortable journey tailored to your preferences.	Admin	data:image/jpeg;base64,	f	2025-03-01 08:08:48.578006	2025-03-01 08:08:48.578006
